level Balrog, what do you do?

59
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:24,367
- I really don't know.

60
00:02:24,367 --> 00:02:26,667
- Quickly, grab your wand,
you fool, grab the wand!

61
00:02:26,667 --> 00:02:29,667
- Uh, I'm grabbing my wand,
I don't know, is it helping?

62
00:02:29,667 --> 00:02:32,700
- No no no, use fireballs,
