70
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,800
- I must take my own life.

71
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,400
- Ah, that's gonna
happen, I guess.

72
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,367
- I guess.
(Tom chanting)

73
00:02:52,367 --> 00:02:53,433
