a deep level (babbling).

80
00:03:13,033 --> 00:03:14,300
- Hey!

81
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:15,633
- Hey Rivendell and
Mordor are calling.

82
00:03:15,633 --> 00:03:16,800
- Those are places!

83
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,800
- Oh, sorry.

84
00:03:18,967 --> 00:03:23,700
- Clay, have you seen
my X-Men number 354?

85
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,700
