194
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:53,000
- [Narrator] Many many years
ago, there was a faraway land

195
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,600
on the other side of the world.

196
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,033
- [Tom] The Catskills!

197
00:07:56,033 --> 00:07:57,433
- [Narrator] A land
richly endowed by nature.

198
00:07:57,433 --> 00:07:58,633
(Tom gulping)
- Wow!

199
00:07:58,633 --> 00:08:00,767
- [Narrator] A land
of golden lakes,

200
00:08:00,767 --> 00:08:04,000
rolling hills, and fertile soil.

201
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:07,600
But hovering over this once
happy land like an evil cloud--

202
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:09,033
- [Mike] (gasping)
George Clinton!

203
00:08:09,033 --> 00:08:11,067
- [Narrator] Was the
face of a ruthless enemy.

204
00:08:11,067 --> 00:08:12,567
- [Tom] I said no cameras!

205
00:08:12,567 --> 00:08:15,567
