and burned its cities!

210
00:08:21,467 --> 00:08:22,900
- [Tom] King Friday's kingdom!

211
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:24,067
- [Narrator] Leaving desolation

212
00:08:24,067 --> 00:08:26,033
and despair in
their terrible path!

213
00:08:26,033 --> 00:08:28,433
- And bad editing in their wake!

214
00:08:28,433 --> 00:08:29,500
