you'll only encourage him!

234
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,933
- God had given him
the body of a warrior.

235
00:09:11,933 --> 00:09:15,767
- Blades are useless and he
cannot move a single step.

236
00:09:15,767 --> 00:09:18,233
