there is no need to be
hasty about killing me.

1701
01:11:23,633 --> 01:11:25,933
First, you must take the
treasures that are yours!

1702
01:11:25,933 --> 01:11:27,300
(raider yelping)
- Hit me!

1703
01:11:28,833 --> 01:11:31,567
(jingling)
- He's got all our spoons!

1704
01:11:31,567 --> 01:11:33,600
(dramatic music)

1705
