Ilya's plan kick in?

1706
01:11:37,933 --> 01:11:40,100
- He's got a Dick
Butkus intensity!

1707
01:11:42,933 --> 01:11:43,900
- [Mike] You're mad, aren't you?

1708
01:11:43,900 --> 01:11:45,400
You're mad!
(man screaming)

1709
01:11:45,400 --> 01:11:48,733
- That's telling
him, sir! (yelping)

1710
01:11:48,733 --> 01:11:50,100
- [Tom] He's worse
than Bobby Knight!

1711
01:11:50,100 --> 01:11:51,333
- [Mike] No, it's Bob!

1712
01:11:51,333 --> 01:11:53,600
- Who so ever steals
from me will die

1713
