1723
01:12:20,100 --> 01:12:22,233
- [Mike] Oh, that was
gratuitous, Ted, come on!

1724
01:12:24,267 --> 01:12:25,433
- [Tom] Oh, and it
goes without saying,

1725
01:12:25,433 --> 01:12:27,033
do it like the dogs you are!

1726
01:12:29,267 --> 01:12:31,767
(Tom humming)

1727
01:12:35,367 --> 01:12:36,600
(Kalin laughing)

1728
01:12:36,600 --> 01:12:38,967
- Ah, this is better
than shopping by mail!

1729
01:12:40,100 --> 01:12:41,900
- [Mike] Ilya's
plan seems ungainly.

1730
01:12:42,900 --> 01:12:44,100
- [Tom] Ah yes, Michael Ovitz

1731
01:12:44,100 --> 01:12:45,767
at his monthly
manager's meeting!

1732
01:12:45,767 --> 01:12:48,033
(clanking)

1733
01:12:50,300 --> 01:12:52,233
- Here, hope you choke on it!

1734
01:12:52,233 --> 01:12:55,200
- [Mike] There goes my
laundry money, you dickweed!

1735
01:12:55,200 --> 01:12:56,000
Fine!

1736
01:12:58,000 --> 01:13:00,633
- [Tom] Thanks to you, it's
working, the United Way!

1737
01:13:00,633 --> 01:13:05,000
