what great riches you have now?

1738
01:13:05,000 --> 01:13:06,667
- But it is not enough!

1739
01:13:06,667 --> 01:13:07,933
- I want Moose and Squirrel!

1740
01:13:07,933 --> 01:13:10,333
- I still lack one thing
to make me content.

1741
01:13:10,333 --> 01:13:14,533
Bring to me Ilya Muromets,
that is what I'd like!

1742
01:13:14,533 --> 01:13:16,700
Then shall I retreat
from your gaze.

1743
01:13:18,100 --> 01:13:19,633
- So shall it be, mighty Kalin!

1744
01:13:21,167 --> 01:13:22,333
- [Mike] Yo, baby,
you heard him!

1745
01:13:22,333 --> 01:13:25,267
- Return to the palace,
go to the dungeon

1746
01:13:25,267 --> 01:13:29,500
