tell him that, do
you understand?

1752
01:13:40,300 --> 01:13:42,067
- Am I alone here, hello?

1753
01:13:43,800 --> 01:13:47,233
- O Mighty Chief Kalin, we
have searched along every road,

1754
01:13:47,233 --> 01:13:48,867
