1794
01:15:23,233 --> 01:15:24,367
I want him alive!

1795
01:15:24,367 --> 01:15:25,900
(dramatic music)

1796
01:15:25,900 --> 01:15:28,600
- Might Chief, your allies
have fled, they refuse

1797
01:15:28,600 --> 01:15:31,067
to join you and your men in
the attack on Prince Vanda!

1798
01:15:31,067 --> 01:15:32,800
- Ah!
- That felt good!

1799
