- [Mike] Sunday, Sunday, Sunday!

1808
01:15:55,500 --> 01:15:58,100
- [Tom] Great, my fruitcake
son is calling me.

1809
01:15:58,100 --> 01:16:01,167
- Come, my young braggart
who shouts so loudly,

1810
01:16:01,167 --> 01:16:03,267
I am ready to beat
you in single combat!

1811
01:16:03,267 --> 01:16:06,500
- You are too old and feeble,
you are no match for me!

1812
01:16:06,500 --> 01:16:07,967
Go home, old man!

1813
01:16:07,967 --> 01:16:09,300
- Hey, I walk the mall!

1814
01:16:09,300 --> 01:16:11,400
