a falcon, young man,

1815
01:16:11,400 --> 01:16:12,800
before you bind him!

1816
01:16:12,800 --> 01:16:14,500
- You are afraid to fight, eh?

1817
01:16:14,500 --> 01:16:17,000
Now I shall show you
no mercy, old one!

1818
