- Father!
- Yes, son?

1822
01:16:25,500 --> 01:16:28,367
- I want to kill you, Mother?

1823
01:16:28,367 --> 01:16:29,567
- Guys.
- I want--

1824
01:16:29,567 --> 01:16:31,267
- [Mike] Guys.

1825
01:16:31,267 --> 01:16:32,433
- [Tom] This is gonna turn into

1826
