when you could, old man?

1840
01:17:12,767 --> 01:17:15,133
I would've shown you no
mercy were I in your place!

1841
01:17:15,133 --> 01:17:18,300
- Be not so fiery, my
wild unbroken colt!

1842
01:17:18,300 --> 01:17:21,633
Tell me your name, young man,
and what do they call you?

1843
01:17:21,633 --> 01:17:23,900
Who are your father and mother?

1844
