- Oh great, my dad's Burl Ives!

1848
01:17:34,800 --> 01:17:36,500
- Do you speak the
truth, old man?

1849
01:17:37,633 --> 01:17:39,067
Is this really the truth?

1850
01:17:39,067 --> 01:17:40,800
- Yes, I speak the truth!

1851
01:17:40,800 --> 01:17:42,167
Look now, I will show you.

1852
01:17:42,167 --> 01:17:44,100
- [Ton] I got a little
birthmark on my left buttcheek.

1853
01:17:44,100 --> 01:17:47,133
- See, this is my
ring you are wearing.

1854
01:17:47,133 --> 01:17:49,433
