into phase nine.

1880
01:18:53,400 --> 01:18:55,467
- You will take the
left flank, Alexi.

1881
01:18:55,467 --> 01:18:56,933
- [Mike] I like white meat!

1882
01:18:56,933 --> 01:18:58,800
