follow along the right flank

1883
01:19:00,267 --> 01:19:03,500
and I will lead my men through
the center of their ranks.

1884
01:19:03,500 --> 01:19:06,267
The Prince remains here with
his men to defend a palace.

1885
01:19:06,267 --> 01:19:09,167
- [Mike] Foghat
prepares for war!

1886
01:19:09,167 --> 01:19:10,367
(crowd shouting)

1887
01:19:10,367 --> 01:19:12,433
- [Tom And Crow] No
rain, no rain, no rain!

1888
01:19:15,433 --> 01:19:19,400
- [Tom] We are live from
beautiful Trojan Stadium today!

1889
01:19:22,833 --> 01:19:27,833
